    "created_at": "2017-01-25T01:11:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-25T01:11:00Z",
    "body": "I think using createImageBitmap is overkill, requiring a number of steps, and that you remember to delete any references to the original canvas. freeze() is a pretty obvious and simple API.",
